%% Diagrama de Sequencia: Alerta de Late Registration no Grind Live
%% Mostra a comunicacao temporal entre componentes durante o ciclo de vida
%% do alerta, desde a montagem do Grind Live ate o disparo da notificacao.

sequenceDiagram
    actor User as Jogador
    participant GL as GrindLive<br/>(React Page)
    participant Hook as useLateRegAlerts<br/>(Custom Hook)
    participant Timer as setInterval<br/>(30s loop)
    participant Toast as useToast<br/>(Toast System)
    participant Audio as Web Audio API<br/>(AudioContext)
    participant BN as Browser<br/>Notification API
    participant API as Express API
    participant DB as PostgreSQL

    Note over User, DB: FASE 1 — Montagem e Inicializacao

    User->>GL: Abre /grind-live
    GL->>API: GET /api/user-settings
    API->>DB: SELECT lateRegAlertMinutes,<br/>lateRegAlertEnabled, lateRegAlertSound
    DB-->>API: { alertMinutes: 10, enabled: true, sound: true }
    API-->>GL: user settings com preferencias de alerta

    GL->>Hook: Inicializa useLateRegAlerts(tournaments, settings)
    Hook->>Hook: Cria alertedSet = new Set() via useRef

    alt lateRegAlertEnabled == true
        Hook->>BN: Notification.requestPermission()
        BN-->>Hook: "granted" | "denied" | "default"
        Hook->>Timer: Inicia setInterval(checkAlerts, 30000)
    else lateRegAlertEnabled == false
        Hook->>Hook: Timer NAO inicia. Nenhum alerta.
    end

    Note over User, DB: FASE 2 — Ciclo de Verificacao (a cada 30s)

    loop A cada 30 segundos
        Timer->>Hook: tick — checkAlerts()

        loop Para cada torneio upcoming com lateRegMinutes != null
            Hook->>Hook: deadline = startTime + lateRegMinutes
            Hook->>Hook: remaining = deadline - Date.now()
            Hook->>Hook: threshold = torneio.alertMinutesBefore ?? settings.lateRegAlertMinutes

            alt remaining <= threshold AND remaining > 0 AND !alertedSet.has(id)
                Hook->>Hook: alertedSet.add(torneio.id)

                Note over Toast, BN: DISPARO SIMULTANEO (3 camadas)

                par Toast (sempre)
                    Hook->>Toast: toast({ variant: "destructive",<br/>title: "Late Reg Encerrando!",<br/>description: "Torneio X — Late ate HH:mm",<br/>action: botao "Registrar",<br/>duration: 30000 })
                    Toast-->>User: Toast vermelho na tela
                and Som (se habilitado)
                    alt settings.lateRegAlertSound == true
                        Hook->>Audio: new AudioContext()
                        Hook->>Audio: createOscillator(880Hz, sine)
                        Hook->>Audio: createGain(fade-out 200ms)
                        Audio-->>User: Beep 880Hz por 200ms
                    end
                and Browser Notification (se permitido)
                    alt Notification.permission == "granted"
                        Hook->>BN: new Notification("Grindfy — Late Reg Encerrando!",<br/>{ body, icon: grindfy-logo.png })
                        BN-->>User: Notificacao do SO
                    end
                end
            end
        end
    end

    Note over User, DB: FASE 3 — Interacao do Usuario com o Alerta

    alt Usuario clica "Registrar" no toast
        User->>Toast: Clica botao "Registrar"
        Toast->>GL: callback: updateTournamentStatus(id, "registered")
        GL->>API: PUT /api/session-tournaments/:id<br/>{ status: "registered" }
        API->>DB: UPDATE session_tournaments SET status = 'registered'
        DB-->>API: OK
        API-->>GL: torneio atualizado
        GL-->>User: Status visual muda para "registered"
    else Usuario clica na Browser Notification
        User->>BN: Clica na notificacao
        BN->>GL: window.focus()
        GL-->>User: Aba do Grindfy focada
    else Toast expira (30s)
        Toast-->>User: Toast desaparece automaticamente
    end

    Note over User, DB: FASE 4 — Edicao de Late Reg (recalculo)

    User->>GL: Edita lateRegMinutes de torneio (60 -> 90)
    GL->>API: PUT /api/session-tournaments/:id<br/>{ lateRegMinutes: 90 }
    API->>DB: UPDATE session_tournaments
    DB-->>API: OK
    API-->>GL: torneio atualizado
    GL->>Hook: tournaments state atualizado
    Hook->>Hook: alertedSet.delete(torneio.id)
    Note over Hook: Novo deadline calculado. Se dentro do<br/>threshold, alerta disparara no proximo tick.

    Note over User, DB: FASE 5 — Cleanup

    User->>GL: Sai do Grind Live (navega para outra pagina)
    GL->>Hook: useEffect cleanup
    Hook->>Timer: clearInterval(timerId)
    Hook->>Hook: alertedSet descartado (garbage collected)
